    {
      "name": "Cart",
      "route": "/cart",
      "memory": [
        "A product bought in two sizes is two CartLines; the line's option (e.g. \"1 kg\") is shown only when the product has one",
        "DecreaseButton is disabled at quantity 1; use RemoveButton to drop a line",
        "Coupons are validated by POST /api/coupons; CouponStatus gets data-checked=\u003cthe code you typed\u003e once the answer is in, whether valid or not. SAVE10 is 10% off, WELCOME5 is $5 off, anything else is rejected",
        "Cart Total excludes shipping; shipping is chosen at checkout"
      ],
      "components": [
