    {
      "name": "Checkout",
      "route": "/checkout",
      "memory": [
        "With an empty cart the page renders CheckoutEmpty instead of the form; add something first",
        "Validation runs on submit only. Errors appear as one FieldError per field (data-field is the input's name) plus a FormErrors summary; the page does not navigate",
        "A valid submit navigates client-side to /orders/:id and empties the cart",
        "Shipping is Standard ($5.00) or Express ($15.00); SummaryTotal includes it, the cart's Total did not"
      ],
