    {
      "name": "Catalog",
      "route": "/",
      "memory": [
        "Nine products; Sumatra Mandheling is sold out, so its QuickAddButton is disabled and quick_add_to_cart on it times out rather than adding",
        "Search matches name and description, case-insensitively; \"coffee\" finds nothing because no product is named that way — filter by category instead",
        "Sort labels are exactly \"Featured\", \"Price: low to high\", \"Price: high to low\", \"Name\"",
        "Quick add always adds one unit of the product's first option; use the product page to pick a size or quantity"
      ],
